# nvblox cell maps: committed only when under ~50 MB (see cumotion/maps/README.md).
# The 2026-08-28 scan is 74.9 MB, so it lives on the host at
# ~/ur10/cumotion/maps/ instead; start_cumotion_map.sh searches there too.
*.nvblx
*.ply

# Kit WebRTC livestream (sim/isaac_human/run_live_view.sh) writes NvStreamer
